{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22529","headline":"和渭北刘大夫借便秋遮虏寄朝中亲友 · 白居易","name":"和渭北刘大夫借便秋遮虏寄朝中亲友","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"巨镇爲邦屏，全材作国桢。\n韬钤汉上将，文墨鲁诸生。\n豹虎关西卒，金汤渭北城。\n宠深初受棨，威重正扬兵。\n阵占山河布，军谙水草行。\n夏苗侵虎落，宵遁失蕃营。\n云队攒戈戟，风行卷斾旌。\n堠空烽火灭，气胜鼓鼙鸣。\n胡马辞南牧，周师罢北征。\n回头问天下，何处有欃枪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22529.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22529","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}